#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/flash-the-screen-for-alert-sounds.md:0
msgid ""
"Turn on visual alerts so the screen or window flashes instead of playing an "
"alert sound if you can't hear it or need silence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/flash-the-screen-for-alert-sounds.md:7
msgid "Topics: Accessibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/flash-the-screen-for-alert-sounds.md:11
msgid "Flash the screen for alert sounds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/flash-the-screen-for-alert-sounds.md:13
msgid ""
"Your computer will play a simple alert sound for certain types of messages "
"and events. If you have a hard time hearing these sounds, you can have "
"either the entire screen or your current window visually flash whenever the "
"alert sound is played."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/flash-the-screen-for-alert-sounds.md:15
msgid ""
"This can also be useful if you’re in an environment where you need your "
"computer to be silent, such as in a library. See Choose or disable the alert "
"sound to learn how to mute the alert sound, then enable visual alerts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/flash-the-screen-for-alert-sounds.md:17
msgid "Open the Activities overview and start typing **accessibility**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/flash-the-screen-for-alert-sounds.md:18
msgid "Click {guilabel}`Accessibility` to open the panel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/flash-the-screen-for-alert-sounds.md:19
msgid "Open the {guilabel}`Hearing` section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/flash-the-screen-for-alert-sounds.md:20
msgid ""
"In the {guilabel}`Visual Alerts` section, enable the {guilabel}`Visual "
"Alerts` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/flash-the-screen-for-alert-sounds.md:21
msgid ""
"Under {guilabel}`Flash Area`, select whether you want the entire screen or "
"just your current window title to flash."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/flash-the-screen-for-alert-sounds.md:24
msgid ""
"You can quickly turn visual alerts on and off by clicking the {ref}"
"`accessibility icon <find-the-accessibility-menu>` on the top bar and "
"selecting {guilabel}`Visual Alerts`."
msgstr ""
